          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What type of products do you offer? ",
            "answer": "<p>Cavirk specialises in handcrafted sarees, stoles and shawls that combine traditional artistry with modern elegance. Our collection features exquisite designs, including vibrant Madhubani paintings on luxurious tussar silk, as well as intricate Pattachitra art on Bangalore and Murshidabad silk, exquisite Kantha Stitch designs, elegant Aari and Soni work on Cashmere fine wool or Pure Pashmina, and also the famous Kinnaur Shawls from the upper region of the Himalayas. Cavirk will be introducing more products in the portfolio very soon.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_Gicg7X": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What makes Cavirk products a unique choice for special occasions? ",
            "answer": "<p>At Cavirk, each product is a masterpiece, meticulously handcrafted to embody the rich tapestry of tradition interwoven with contemporary elegance. Our exquisite Madhubani and Pattachitra paintings, rendered on sumptuous Tussar and Mulberry silk, transform each piece into a narrative of artistry, making them not merely garments, but cherished heirlooms for your most memorable celebrations.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_836jPJ": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the care regimen for maintaining the beauty of my Cavirk saree? ",
            "answer": "<p>To preserve the intricate artistry and luxurious fabric of your saree, we advise Dry Cleaning only. Avoid direct sunlight and harsh chemicals, as these may diminish the vibrancy of the colours and the finesse of the craftsmanship. Treat your saree with the reverence it deserves, and it will remain a timeless treasure.</p>"
          }
        },
