            "answer": "<p>Each saree at Cavirk is handcrafted by skilled artisans, ensuring authenticity and quality. We provide detailed descriptions and images of each piece, allowing customers to appreciate the unique craftsmanship and cultural significance behind every saree. Also, most of the silk sarees come with the government Silk-mark.</p>"
          }
        },
