            "answer": "<p>We accept return for manufacturing defects or incorrect product shipment only. You have 7 days to return an item from the date you received it. To be eligible for a return, the saree must be unused and in the same condition as received, including the original packaging. Please retain your proof of purchase for the return process.</p>"
